<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="hero">
  <img src="/static/img/logo-large.png" alt="NISMCAA logo" width="150" height="150">
  <h1>NISMCAA Meeting Room</h1>
  <p>A private members area for NISMCAA volunteers in the United States, Nigeria, Canada, the United Arab Emirates, the United Kingdom and Australia.</p>
  <p>Volunteer, take the course, pass the final test, get approved by an administrator, and join your country team.</p>
  <p>
    <% if (user) { %><a class="btn gold" href="/meeting-room">Open the Meeting Room</a>
    <% } else { %><a class="btn gold" href="/meeting-room">Meeting Room (members sign in)</a> <a class="btn gold" href="/sign-up">Sign up to volunteer</a> <a class="btn ghost" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:#fff" href="/sign-in">Sign in</a><% } %>
  </p>
</section>
<div class="grid">
  <div class="card"><h3>1. Learn</h3><p>Read the volunteer course. It is open to everyone, no sign-in needed. <a href="/course">Open the course</a>.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>2. Take the final test</h3><p>50 questions. To pass you need 80% overall and at least 9 of 10 on the child-protection questions.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>3. Get approved</h3><p>An administrator reviews your application, confirms your country and department, and issues your volunteer ID card.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>4. Join the team</h3><p>Approved volunteers use the call link, chat, notes and the action plan for their country.</p></div>
</div>
<p class="note">This is a volunteer role. There is no salary and there are no fees. NISMCAA never asks volunteers to pay anything.</p>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
